Package: softgred
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ebtables, iptables
Recommends: python3 (>= 3.9), logrotate
Description: Dynamic GRE Ethernet tunnel provisioning for Linux
 Discovers IPv4 GRE Ethernet peers, provisions gretap and VLAN interfaces,
 and connects them to configured Linux bridges. Includes a read-only TCP
 status API and isolated firewall rules for learned source MAC addresses.
